n flags (Altman Z 6.5, in the safe zone).","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 2.66).","Working capital ties up about 140 days of sales, a drag on cash generation."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 6.1% over 3 years, 9.0% over 5 years and 2.1% over 10 years, so growth is decelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 18%).","At current returns, reinvesting 10% of profits supports about 1.6% a year of fundamental growth, too little to drive meaningful growth.","Free cash flow has compounded 61.5% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: a book-to-bill of 0.96, a backlog worth 81% of annual revenue and deferred revenue up 11%.","Capex runs 1.7x depreciation (6.1% of sales), so it is building capacity for future growth.","Its Rule of 40 score is 16, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.8%), and institutions hold 100%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (31 sales, net $49.7M sold).","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.9% (1.9% in buybacks).","The share count has grown 1.3% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 7,600 employees, each generates about $604K of revenue, 1.7x the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 2.6% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $44K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $3.5M (6x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $4K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":50,"head":"Avoid: priced 237% above its fair value of $54.28.","pros":["Revenue grew 9.0%/yr over 5y","Piotroski F-score 9/9","Altman Z in the safe zone","10 analysts' mean target $243 (+33%)","12-1 month momentum +93%"],"cons":["Trades 237% above fair value of $54.28","P/E 45.8x vs sector 24.1x","EV/EBITDA 26.3x vs sector 13.4x","P/FCF 74.5x vs sector 22.9x"],"flags":["Priced 237% above its fair value of $54.28"],"need":[],"buy_below":46.14,"vc":{"